{
  "iri": "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_90865",
  "lang": "en",
  "description": [
    "An <em>N</em>-alkylpiperazine that is 1-[2-(1,3-dihydro-2-oxobenzimidazol-1-yl)ethyl]piperazine in which the remaining amino proton is replaced by a 3-(trifluoromethyl)phenyl group. A multifunctional serotonin agonist and antagonist which is used for the treatment of pre-menopausal women with hypoactive sexual desire disorder."
  ],
